                     Filter: (a < 42)
               ->  Hash
                     ->  Dynamic Seq Scan on our_table
                           Number of partitions to scan: 4 (out of 4)
                           Filter: (a < 42)
         ->  Hash
               ->  Seq Scan on your_table
                     Filter: (a < 42)
 Optimizer: GPORCA
(15 rows)

